      "id": "thm-rmk-positive-functional-is-integration-against-its-representing-measure",
      "statement": "Let X be LCH and let Lambda:C_c(X;R)->R be positive. The Radon measure mu constructed above satisfies Lambda(f)=integral_X f dmu for every f in C_c(X;R).",
